  "description": "FormulaEngineer is a high-performance .NET library that reads, writes, and accurately evaluates Excel (XLSX) formulas — without requiring Excel to be installed.\n\n\t\t\t✓ Accurate formula evaluation — a from-scratch engine verified against hundreds of real-world formulas, matching Excel's output to last-bit floating-point precision\n\t\t\t✓ 374 Excel functions across lookup, financial, statistical, math, text, date/time, logical, information, engineering, dynamic-array, and database families\n\t\t\t✓ Dynamic arrays, structured table references, cross-sheet INDIRECT, spill semantics, and full error propagation\n\t\t\t✓ Ultra-fast, forward-only streaming reader and writer — no loading the entire file into memory\n\t\t\t✓ Culture-aware parsing of dates, times, durations, numbers, and booleans\n\t\t\t✓ Shared string deduplication with overflow protection\n\t\t\t✓ Precise ECMA-376 format detection for date/time/duration values\n\t\t\t✓ Safe XML parsing\n\n\t\t\tCross-platform, pure managed code for .NET 6 and later. Ideal for ASP.NET Core Web APIs, Blazor Server/WASM, Windows Forms, WPF, background services, console applications, and serverless environments (Azure Functions, AWS Lambda).",
