  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0 expands FormulaEngineer to 374 user-facing Excel functions, adding Arabic, expanded statistical functions, dynamic-array helpers such as HSTACK, VSTACK, WRAPCOLS, WRAPROWS, TOCOL, TOROW, TAKE, DROP, EXPAND, plus RANDARRAY, SORTBY, and ROMAN.",
